<title>JAPAN: Clarke unsure if Bonn, Paris will meet EMU terms.</title>
<headline>Clarke unsure if Bonn, Paris will meet EMU terms.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Chancellor of the Exchequer Kenneth Clarke said on Thursday he was uncertain whether Germany or France would be able to meet all criteria to join the European Monetary Union.</p>
<p>Clarke arrived in Japan on Wednesday to meet senior Japanese government officials.</p>
</text>
